	<title>A Hologram for the King</title>
	<isbn>193636574X</isbn>
	<publication_year>2012</publication_year>
	<language_code>eng</language_code>
	<description>In a rising Saudi Arabian city, far from weary, recession-scarred America, a struggling businessman pursues a last-ditch attempt to stave off foreclosure, pay his daughter’s college tuition, and finally do something great. In &lt;i&gt;A Hologram for the King&lt;/i&gt;, Dave Eggers takes us around the world to show how one man fights to hold himself and his splintering family together in the face of the global economy’s gale-force winds. This taut, richly layered, and elegiac novel is a powerful evocation of our contemporary moment — and a moving story of how we got here.</description>
